            <h1
              class='text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3 sm:mb-4 font-montserrat'
            >Kesatria Academy</h1>
            <p
              class='text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-inter'
            >Empowering Future Digital Tech Talent’s</p>
          </div>

          <div class='prose prose-lg max-w-none'>
            <!-- YouTube Video Float -->
            <div class='float-right ml-4 mb-4 w-full sm:w-80 md:w-96 sm:pl-4'>
              <div
                class='relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg'
                style='padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;'
              >
                <iframe
                  class='absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full'
                  src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ'
                  title='YouTube video player'
                  frameborder='0'
                  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture'
                  allowfullscreen
                >
                </iframe>
              </div>
            </div>
{{#if paragraf.length}}
            {{#each paragraf}}
              <p
                class='text-sm sm:text-base text-justify text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 sm:mb-6 font-inter'
              >
                {{this.paragraf}}
              </p>
            {{/each}}

            {{else}}
              <p
                class='text-sm sm:text-base text-justify text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 sm:mb-6 font-inter'
              >
Kesatria Academy merupakan layanan edukasi yang berfokus pada pengembangan talenta digital yang unggul di bidang teknologi informasi. Layanan Kesatria Academy dirancang untuk menjawab kebutuhan nyata industri sekaligus mendukung transformasi digital.
              </p>
              <p
                class='text-sm sm:text-base text-justify text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 sm:mb-6 font-inter'
              >
Kesatria Academy percaya bahwa pendidikan teknologi tidak hanya berhenti pada penguasaan teori, melainkan mampu melahirkan kemampuan praktis, etos kerja profesional, serta portofolio yang diakui secara global.
              </p>
              {{/if}}
            <div class='clear-both'></div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mission Section -->
        <div
          x-show="activeSection === 'mission'"
          x-transition:enter='transition ease-out duration-300'
          x-transition:enter-start='opacity-0 transform translate-y-4'
          x-transition:enter-end='opacity-100 transform translate-y-0'
        >
          <div class='mb-6 sm:mb-8'>
            <h1
              class='text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3 sm:mb-4 font-montserrat'
